''
'' MSX BASIC PLAY reference example.
''
'' MSX BASIC allows PSG channels to be supplied as comma-separated PLAY
'' strings.  sfxlib now accepts this form too, so the listing body remains the
'' same as the reference example.
''
'' Source:
''   https://www.msx.org/wiki/PLAY
''

#lang "qb"

10 PLAY "CDE","EFG"

'' end of play_two_channels.bas
